  "description": "Unofficial patched build of the MemoryPack source generator (based on Cysharp/MemoryPack 1.22.0; pair it with MemoryPack.Core 1.22.0). TypeScript generator changes: DateTimeOffset, IReadOnlyList, IReadOnlyCollection and IReadOnlyDictionary support (fixes MEMPACK031 for those types; see Cysharp/MemoryPack PR #459); nullable readers that inspect only the HasValue byte, so a null with non-zero padding is not read as a value; runtime files rewritten when their content changes; and the opt-in MemoryPackGenerator_TypeScriptDictionaryAsRecord build property, which emits string/number-keyed dictionaries as Record instead of Map (same wire format). Drop-in replacement for MemoryPack.Generator; use together with the official MemoryPack.Core package instead of the MemoryPack meta package.",
